。\n\n構図等は全てお任せします。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n\n参考↓\nhttps://musical-isotope.kamitsubaki.jp/product/coko/\nhttps://x.com/_swav_/status/1547903874249269248?s=46&t=50ns7oJGvbFqw9foOUNTig\nhttps://musical-isotope.kamitsubaki.jp/comics/430/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekakigoon/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7539369a/uploads/origins/ff01078b-fdcf-419d-ab23-1923d0701d41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec39c61879a8b86928cf4a7644b2128c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7539369a/uploads/origins/ff01078b-fdcf-419d-ab23-1923d0701d41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec39c61879a8b86928cf4a7644b2128c, https://si.imgix.net/7539369a/uploads/origins/ff01078b-fdcf-419d-ab23-1923d0701d41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef26901322f25cb2f855b39a56e7ad46 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7539369a/uploads/origins/ff01078b-fdcf-419d-ab23-1923d0701d41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a91780e07813c023b303e1c55d30c67 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "尻がデカいオネちゃんをお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}